    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0</strong>About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421810/extras/954548aa0232b928637560b13ae6dd1f.avif?t=1755197131\" width=600 height=848 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Shoot 'em up meets Brick Breaker action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid enemy fire, bounce back bullets, and fight your way through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master unique skills and wave attacks to unleash powerful combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Playable Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Phurl</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skilled at controlling Waves.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421810/extras/5595a4f4444e98c676ccc7746459441a.avif?t=1755197131\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Eire</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excels in speed.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421810/extras/07eb05693ed1c087a624280b74dee8b1.avif?t=1755197131\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Till</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capable of increasing power.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421810/extras/382a8c4db1f9e2bb736ad6b6ca9f0c38.avif?t=1755197131\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0</strong>About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421810/extras/954548aa0232b928637560b13ae6dd1f.avif?t=1755197131\" width=600 height=848 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Shoot 'em up meets Brick Breaker action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid enemy fire, bounce back bullets, and fight your way through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master unique skills and wave attacks to unleash powerful combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Playable Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Phurl</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skilled at controlling Waves.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421810/extras/5595a4f4444e98c676ccc7746459441a.avif?t=1755197131\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Eire</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excels in speed.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421810/extras/07eb05693ed1c087a624280b74dee8b1.avif?t=1755197131\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Till</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capable of increasing power.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421810/extras/382a8c4db1f9e2bb736ad6b6ca9f0c38.avif?t=1755197131\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p>",
